      "id": "claim_94e6f7dfdde840309c6fc3d276f8dbd6",
      "statement": "The wire protocol is a single protobuf Message with an id (the file name used as the transfer correlation key) and a oneof data: fileMetadata, filePartMetaData, chunk, fileEvent, filePartEvent; it is defined in src/proto/message.proto and compiled to src/proto/message.ts via the protogen script (ts-proto).",
