      "id": "claim_bb8002622b5f4ed388b1cc138cbf01eb",
      "statement": "Files are multiplexed across WebRTC data channels: requestedFilePartChannelCount = min(MAX_DATA_CHANNELS=16, ceil(file.size/bytesPerChannel)) where bytesPerChannel defaults to 25MB (settingAtom.bytesPerDataChannel), active channel count = min(requested, open channels), partSize = ceil(file.size/channelCount), and if no channels are open the send aborts with a toast.",
